        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>NGP 16DKB-84 2-1/2 x 84 Dark Bronze Rain Drip Guard</b>\r\n<p>\r\n2-1/2\" projection x 84\" length dark bronze rain drip guard. These drip guards are made from non rusting T5 aluminum alloy and used on exterior doors to prevent rain water from dripping into the door top. They screw onto the top of the door frame or above the frame. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAnodized Dark Bronze finish Aluminum.  Packaged with #6 x 3/4\" stainless steel SMS. Screw holes slotted for easy adjustment. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for NGP 16DKB-84 84\" Drip Guard\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 84\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Height: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: T5 aluminum alloy</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Anodized Dark Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Installation Screws: 6 x 3/4\" stainless steel SMS Screws</li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually.</b>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>**Special Made to Order Item. NOT RETURNABLE.</b>\r\n</p>",
